      "content": "13.4 Mnemonics for Exam Preparation"
    },
    {
      "id": "6c6salw",
      "type": "list",
      "items": [
        "OSI Layers (top-bottom): All People Seem To Need Data Processing → Application, Presentation, Session, Transport, Network, Data Link, Physical",
        "OSI Layers (bottom-top): Please Do Not Throw Sausage Pizza Away → Physical, Data Link, Network, Transport, Session, Presentation, Application",
        "ACID properties: Angry Customers Ignore Delays → Atomicity, Consistency, Isolation, Durability",
        "SOLID principles: Single-Open-Liskov-Interface-Dependency → S.O.L.I.D",
        "Sorting complexities: O(n²) sorts — BIS (Bubble, Insertion, Selection); O(n log n) — MQH (Merge, Quick, Heap)",
        "Coffman deadlock conditions: HNCP — Hold-and-wait, No-preemption, Circular-wait, Mutual-exclusion",
        "TCP 3-way handshake: SYN → SYN-ACK → ACK (I Synchronise → I Acknowledge your Sync → I Acknowledge)",
        "IPv4 private ranges: 10.x, 172.16-31.x, 192.168.x.x (the three RFC 1918 private blocks)",
        "Normalisation: 1NF=atomic; 2NF=no partial dependency; 3NF=no transitive dependency; BCNF=every determinant is a superkey",
        "CAP Theorem: Consistency, Availability, Partition Tolerance — can only guarantee 2 of 3 simultaneously"
      ]
    },
